      "raw": "Ohh, fantastic opening, love it. :D They finally made it happen!\n\nOh wow, the cover though :O Probably spoiled half the episode, lol\n\nI never knew there was a DBZ RPG. And their description of it reminds me of the Sailor Moon RPG my roomates and I couldn't \n\nunderstand in college. XD\n\nClearly, Adam needs Redbubble.\n\nI really like the use of Ray Manta to set this other villain up. :D\n\nIt's a double monologue, all the way!\n\n\"And he's gone\" is always a funny line to end a scene on.\n\nLet's hear it for crappy 80's CGI! :D\n\nOoh, they're going through a tunnel again :)\n\n\"Why Matt?\" what a question to have to ask XD\n\nI love everyone running with the joke about Calypso's age.\n\nHey, it me! :D I'm so glad I got one more \"asbestos-coated anti-Ra room\" out of them.\n\nGood ending gag too :)",
